your family had a second heiress.

16
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:21,720
You sure know how to lie low.

17
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:24,080
She's always been kept at home.

18
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,200
Such a good girl.

19
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,200
Quite the good girl.

20
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,120
Zhan Xiang,

21
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,040
I don't care what it takes.

22
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,400
Bring her to me.

23
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:31,960
Got it.

24
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:33,880
Miss Lu Mingyu,

25
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,200
may I

26
