158
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,160
Lu Mingyu.

159
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,880
Once I finish things in Xizi City,

160
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,400
come with me to Xiangjiang.

161
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:18,820
♪I'm always here♪

162
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,480
Duan Xiuming.

163
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,680
What's this?

164
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,560
A new way of inviting me?

165
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,600
♪Wherever you are♪

166
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,480
I'm not inviting you.

167
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,320
I'm informing you:

168
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,840
I want to marry you.

169
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:36,660
♪Wherever you go♪

170
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:39,060
♪For you♪

171
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,380
♪Wherever you are♪

172
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:47,140
♪Wherever you go♪

173
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,800
Duan Xiuming...

174
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,400
It's okay.

175
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,080
If it feels too rushed,

176
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,120
we can date first.

177
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,120
We'll go at whatever pace you like.

178
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,160
If possible,

179
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,320
please make it soon.

180
00:09:11,540 --> 00:09:15,620
♪Wherever you go♪

181
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,780
♪Oh, you♪

182
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:20,900
♪Wherever you are♪

183
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:24,140
♪Wherever you go♪

184
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:29,100
♪Wherever you go♪

185
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,460
♪For you♪

186
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:34,660
♪Wherever you are♪

187
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:36,360
♪Wherever you go♪

188
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,040
Wait a minute.

189
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,240
Add me on WeChat.

190
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,200
Don't delete me.

191
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,200
Don't block me.

192
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,960
My family took my phone away.

193
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,920
Come on, you're an adult
and your familystill takes your phone?

194
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,760
Use mine.

195
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,520
No password. Anti-tracking.

196
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,040
No need to delete anything first?

197
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,240
Look all you want.

198
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:05,560
Thanks.

199
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:07,360
I'm off.

200
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,400
(XiA 89988)

201
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:19,160
Remember to reply to my messages.

202
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:39,640
Stop.

203
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,840
Where did you go tonight?

204
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,360
I...

205
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:46,920
Speak.

206
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,280
And also,

207
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,120
where'd you get that outfit?

208
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,360
The outfit

209
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,960
was from my cousin.

210
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,240
Lu Qian gave it to you?

211
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,520
And then?

212
00:10:57,640 --> 00:11:00,320
She took me out tonight.

213
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,320
She wanted to show me around.

214
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,720
And we joined a cocktail party.

215
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,480
Nonsense!

216
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,360
Who allowed her to take you out?

217
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,280
Is that a place you should go?

218
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,040
Lu Mingyu!

219
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:12,840
Where were you tonight?

220
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,360
I looked everywhere for you!

221
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,560
You dare question her?

222
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,200
Dad.

223
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,560
I'd like to ask you:

224
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,520
Who gave you the nerve

225
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,320
to take her to some shady lounge?

226
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:27,880
Dad,

227
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,040
that's just a private party

228
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,560
at Yunding Lounge.

229
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:33,400
Everyone there is a friend.

230
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,360
Private booking, all VIPs.

231
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,920
No shady guys at all.

232
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,560
You should blame her.

233
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,120
I kindly took her out.

234
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:40,920
However,

235
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,200
before long,

236
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,640
she snuck off

237
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,200
to date some random guy.

238
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,240
Uncle,

239
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,440
I didn't go anywhere.

240
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,080
I was at the party the whole time.

241
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,600
She asked me to toast someone.

242
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,840
I accidentally got my clothes wet,

243
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,520
so I went to deal with it.

244
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,800
By the time I got back,

245
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,120
Lu Qian was gone.

246
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,480
I sat there waiting for her.

247
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,960
Then a bunch of guys surrounded me.

248
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,160
I was scared,

249
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:07,720
so I borrowed money from the owner
and took a taxi home.

250
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,160
You're lying!

251
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:11,760
I clearly couldn't find you!

252
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:12,960
I didn't lie.

253
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:13,640
Enough!

254
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,240
Shut up!

255
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:18,480
Lu Lin!

256
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:24,160
Dad.

257
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,120
Head over

258
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,720
to Yunding Lounge

259
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,960
and get me the security footage.

260
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,240
Now!

261
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,400
Got it.

262
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:50,760
Dad.

263
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,960
The footage is here.

264
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,240
I called the lounge,
and the video came through.

265
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,320
It only took ten minutes.

266
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,880
Who's lying

267
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,080
will be clear.

268
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,200
No way...

269
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,360
Impossible!

270
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,080
This is fake!

271
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,080
♪Soft look hides the fire deep inside♪

272
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:49,040
Lu Lin brought back the footage.

273
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,720
Are you saying

274
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,760
Lu Lin tampered with it?

275
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,280
How would I?

276
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,840
Ten minutes wasn't enough

277
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,120
to tamper with it at all!

278
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,760
♪Bite back tears, hold every pain♪

279
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,000
Now that it's just a misunderstanding,

280
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,360
just clear it up.

281
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,520
Come on,

282
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,880
have some fruit.

283
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:06,960
Lu Mingyu must've tampered

284
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,240
with this footage.

285
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:12,340
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

286
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:15,540
♪My own salvation I believe♪

287
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:18,300
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

